╭─ help ─────────────────────────────────────────╮
│↑/↓ or j/k  move selection                      │
│1–5  time range  ·  tab cycle                   │
│f/F  package type forward/back                  │
│s/S  sort forward/back                          │
│/  search name and description                  │
│o  open homepage  ·  i  install                 │
│r  refresh                                      │
│enter  details (narrow terminals)               │
│? or esc  close help                            │
│q  quit                                         │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
